.TH merman-cli-lint-rules 1  "lint-rules 0.8.0-alpha.4"
.SH NAME
merman\-cli\-lint\-rules \- List lint rule metadata
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBmerman\-cli lint\-rules\fR [\fB\-\-format\fR] [\fB\-\-pretty\fR] [\fB\-\-configurable\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] [\fB\-V\fR|\fB\-\-version\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
List lint rule metadata
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-pretty\fR
Pretty\-print JSON output
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
\fB\-V\fR, \fB\-\-version\fR
Print version
.SH OUTPUT
.TP
\fB\-\-format\fR \fI<FORMAT>\fR [default: json]
Output format for rule metadata
.br

.br
\fIPossible values:\fR
.RS 14
.IP \(bu 2
json
.IP \(bu 2
text
.RE
.SH "RULE FILTERS"
.TP
\fB\-\-configurable\fR
Only list rules that public lint configuration can reference
.SH VERSION
v0.8.0\-alpha.4
